gaps-gcp patch 0003: mockgcp serves Cloud SQL backupRuns (insert, get, delete).

For sqladmin.gcp.hfl.dev/SQLAdminBackup. Copied from Config Connector's
open pull request #12553 (head 9611a6de): mockgcp/mocksql/sqlbackup.go as
it is there, its registration in service.go, and the BackupRun case in
operations_store.go. Not copied from the PR: its rewrite of /v1/ paths for
the cloud.google.com/go/sql client (we use the v1beta4 REST client), its
golden-log normalization, and its POSTGRES_14 defaults.

Upstream candidate: it is upstream's own change; drop this patch when the
PR merges and the pin moves past it.

